                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>His excellency the viceroy and governor of the Fohkien province requested me to
                    hand over to you a letter from the high authorities of Foo-Chow, relating to
                    this affair. I shall be happy to deliver it when I have the honor of meeting
                    you.</p>


